  m_Name: 13. ReturnFirstModel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitleText:
  - Aha! It looks like one of
  - the models in your inventory
  - belongs to this exhibit.
  - Open your inventory and click
  - on the model that matches
  - up with the image.
  - Then, keep your camera pointed
  - at the poster and press the
  - '"release model" button to'
  - send it back to the exhibit.
